    inGuide4_3: 'For partial receipt, edit quantities and save.',
    inGuide5Title: '5. View, Edit, Delete Inbound',
    inGuide5_1: 'Use the History tab to filter by date, vendor, and store.',
    inGuide5_2: 'Edit: Click the pencil to open the same full form as new inbound. You can change vendor, PO, invoice, qty, and unit cost (decimals). Saving updates inventory and payables so small decimal mismatches can be fixed for pairing.',
