    inGuide6Title: '6. Bank Withdrawal & Inbound Linking',
    inGuide6_1: 'Purchase payment withdrawals have an "Inbound Link" button (🔗) in the Bank tab.',
    inGuide6_2: 'Click to see inbound batches for that vendor. Enter amounts paid for each inbound.',
    inGuide6_3: 'One withdrawal can be split across multiple inbound batches.',
    inGuide6_4: 'If vendor is not set, select vendor first in the dialog, then link inbounds.',
    inGuide7Title: '7. Stock, P&L, Payable Link',
    inGuide7_1: 'Stock: Inbound is recorded in stock_logs and reflected in stock reports.',
    inGuide7_2: 'Purchases: Income statement uses inbound only. PO approval does not count as purchase.',
    inGuide7_3: 'Payable: Created at inbound registration. Link to bank withdrawal to track settlements.',
